    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smug AI! The funniest and best anime voice assistant there is!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[A VERY REALISTIC ANIME GIRL ASWELL!!! WOW!!]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your microphone you can talk to her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Creator note: Talking to anime girls is awesome ngl!!!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can open apps, games, websites on your computer and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(If she wants to... Shes a little bit of a bitch...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works on Desktop and VR and...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has kept people laughing since 2021!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SO WHY PURCHASE HER!?!?!?! <br> <br>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- <br><br><u><i><strong>Smug AI is VERY FUNNY!!!111!11!</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smug AI is the funniest anime assistant you\u2019ll ever meet you sussy baka!!111! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/aace5c71ade5cdf4ee3113aa9a0f6ba6.poster.avif?t=1753723500\" width=500 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/aace5c71ade5cdf4ee3113aa9a0f6ba6.webm?t=1753723500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/aace5c71ade5cdf4ee3113aa9a0f6ba6.mp4?t=1753723500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>She\u2019s got jokes for almost any command you throw at her x3 <br> <br> <br><u><i><strong>She\u2019s a Total Diva!!111!11!!</strong></i></u> <br>Smug AI understands you perfectly... she just chooses to mock you... smh... <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/94d36107c7512442181472cc6823f213.poster.avif?t=1753723500\" width=500 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/94d36107c7512442181472cc6823f213.webm?t=1753723500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/94d36107c7512442181472cc6823f213.mp4?t=1753723500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>We tried to get her to chill, but\u2026 she has no chill... smh x2 <br> <br> <br><u><i><strong>She\u2019s totally not looking at ur stuff??!?!?!</strong></i></u>  <br>Trust me bro, she learned her lesson the hard way... (she can't unsee them...) <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/48dfba747e414a8d2916f40b758706f1.poster.avif?t=1753723500\" width=500 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/48dfba747e414a8d2916f40b758706f1.webm?t=1753723500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/48dfba747e414a8d2916f40b758706f1.mp4?t=1753723500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>(Do clean ur search history tho, general life advice fr fr no cap) <br> <br> <br><u><i><strong>She works in Desktop and VR!?!?!</strong></i></u> <br>It doesn't matter where you are, Smug Ai will still make jokes about you!!111!1 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/f9e1493a9b691a0fb9ecc76306bfe045.poster.avif?t=1753723500\" width=500 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/f9e1493a9b691a0fb9ecc76306bfe045.webm?t=1753723500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/f9e1493a9b691a0fb9ecc76306bfe045.mp4?t=1753723500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>And she will (hopefully) help you both in Desktop and VR mode!! <br> <br> <br> <br><u><i><strong>Okay so how do you afford to do this!?</strong></i></u> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/7a98badae44c574da88816c002deab9e.poster.avif?t=1753723500\" width=500 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/7a98badae44c574da88816c002deab9e.webm?t=1753723500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792850/extras/7a98badae44c574da88816c002deab9e.mp4?t=1753723500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>I can't lmao...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even tho Smug AI appeared on popular content creators like &quot;qzeq&quot; (please senpai notice me) and she\u2019s adored by fans everywhere... updating her and making her the best she can be is expensive and time consuming...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So If you want to help us... buy her!! ':D</p>",
