        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 4th generation CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> A GPU that actually works<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Works with any audio card (may require external microphone)<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Compatible with SteamVR headsets! Automatically switches to your headset's microphone and appears as a floating window in the SteamVR Dashboard.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> You need a microphone (to make the assistant hear you) + English (United States) [Speech Language Pack] installed</li></ul>",
        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 2nd generation CPU or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> A GPU that actually works good<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Works with any audio card (may require external microphone)<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Compatible with SteamVR headsets! Automatically switches to your headset's microphone and appears as a floating window in the SteamVR Dashboard.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> You need a microphone (to make the assistant hear you) + English (United States) [Speech Language Pack] installed</li></ul>"
